1
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was told the suspect turned himself in.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

2
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By now, he's long gone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

3
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:48,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who'd give up and lose</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the 300-million diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

4
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>PREVIOUSLY</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

5
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Has it really come</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to killing officers now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

6
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's a wanted notice.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

7
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's a reward</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of 100,000 baht per person.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

8
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, stop! It's a woman!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

9
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let me go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

10
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Noona!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

11
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Noona!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

12
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

13
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

14
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:10,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you shocked to see me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

15
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

16
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You didn't tell me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

17
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Seeking help from the authorities</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

18
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is tough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

19
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:20,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Find one of their men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who knows the terrain well</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

20
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to guide us through.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

21
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

22
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, little miss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

23
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please let us go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

24
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:36,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We're just low-level lackeys</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>following General Kao's orders.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

25
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't beg for your life!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

26
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you ever show any mercy</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the people you kidnapped?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

27
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't even know how my child is doing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

28
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's just burn them alive!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

29
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:48,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Calm down, everyone. Please, take it easy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

30
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Everyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

31
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Enough, please.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

32
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:56,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I ask this of you,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and right in front of a monk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

33
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tell me truly,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

34
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>do you want revenge just for satisfaction,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

35
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or do you want to end this problem?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

36
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You there,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

37
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:17,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>how are the villagers who were captured</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>doing right now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

38
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:21,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The ones taken two months ago</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are all still alive.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

39
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about the woman</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>abducted at the market?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

40
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did you take Noona? Tell us!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

41
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She's at the camp across the border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

42
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I captured her myself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

43
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captured her yourself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

44
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Cool it, Boonrod. Relax first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

45
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:37,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Teacher!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Calm down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

46
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just you wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

47
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

48
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what do you plan to do</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with the captured villagers?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

49
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The men are kept for forced labor</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in the camp,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

50
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and the women will be shipped</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>tomorrow morning.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

51
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tomorrow?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

52
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What do we do now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

53
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They have hundreds of men.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

54
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Charging in there is suicide,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

55
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:08,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but waiting for the authorities</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>will take too long.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

56
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

57
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:18,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How long does it take</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to march there on foot from here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

58
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

59
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>About three to four hours.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

60
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

61
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>lead the way?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

62
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Good luck, junior disciple!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

63
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:41,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

64
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:46,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>May the holy lord protect you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>on your journey there and back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

65
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's hope all of us return intact.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

66
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

67
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>here is a map</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

68
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:59,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the forestry radio station.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

69
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's about 20 kilometers away.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

70
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I will get there as fast as I can.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

71
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

72
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:12,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>don't get caught by</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng's men again.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

73
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

74
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We definitely need backup.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

75
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:19,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Otherwise, we won't be able</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to get our people out of there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

76
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay, got it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

77
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stay safe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

78
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

79
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:27,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>may the holy lord protect you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>on your journey there and back too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

80
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:31,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, now go. Move out.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

81
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:34,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let's go. Go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

82
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

83
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

84
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:54,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho, cutting through</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the mountain will be faster.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

85
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>God bless you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

86
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't worry, Tofu will look after him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

87
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

88
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:09,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thank you all very much.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I shall leave now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

89
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's on your mind?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

90
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You look so stressed.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

91
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:30,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm just wondering</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>why you don't trust my ability.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

92
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, darling,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

93
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of course I trust you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

94
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:40,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's just that the property</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is worth hundreds of millions.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

95
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm anxious.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

96
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I told you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

97
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:48,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to leave it to me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

98
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I only wanted to come up</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>here to see if I could</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

99
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>help you with anything.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

100
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm sorry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

101
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By the way,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

102
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:05,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you haven't told me yet</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what brings you up here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

103
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I came to handle your matter.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

104
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:12,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've never been indifferent</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>about your problems.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

105
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want you to know that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

106
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:20,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I will capture the criminal</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who stole your diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

107
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:23,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just trust me</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

108
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and don't do anything on your own.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

109
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

110
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thank you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

111
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop it, please!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

112
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:26,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't want to live anymore!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'd rather die than let them sell me off!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

113
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Calm down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

114
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:34,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>As long as we breathe,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>there is still hope.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

115
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:38,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How can you talk about hope</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>when you can't even save yourself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

116
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You have a point.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

117
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:46,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Giving up and losing heart</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>will only make it worse.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

118
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why hurt yourself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

119
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You want us to sing songs?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wake up from your dream.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

120
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:04,080
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Noona, wait for me.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>I'm on my way to save you.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

121
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You guys are way too slow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

122
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How is Captain Kan's team now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

123
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chansuek was spotted at the border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

124
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The Captain is asking</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the Border Patrol Police for help</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

125
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:52,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>because we feel</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the local police can't be trusted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

126
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Cheewin is another one</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we need to deal with.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

127
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Should I assist you with anything?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

128
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No need.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

129
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:07,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go join Captain Kan.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want Chansuek located quickly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

130
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:10,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want to know what exactly happened</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and where the diamond is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

131
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Understood, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

132
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Papon came here by himself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

133
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

134
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know if he knew anything.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

135
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:32,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just make sure you don't contact me</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at all during this time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

136
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:35,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If something comes up,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll keep you posted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

137
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:10,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Welcome back to camp, General.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

138
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How are things looking around here, Lort?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

139
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:16,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, bring him in!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

140
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:25,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This prisoner tried to escape, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

141
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is there anything else?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

142
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, General.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

143
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>General Kao, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

144
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is it now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

145
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>One of the prisoners</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is trying to commit suicide.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

146
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:58,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you die today, they win.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

147
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:02,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And you will lose the chance</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to return to your loved ones.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

148
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:05,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You really think there's still a chance?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

149
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:09,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No one can save us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We're never getting out of here alive.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

150
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:22,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Look up at me. Look me in the eye.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

151
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:27,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm right here in this cage with you,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

152
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:29,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but I refuse to give up.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

153
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I won't let them</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

154
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:34,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>write the final chapter of my life for me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

155
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Listen.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

156
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Listen to me, everyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

157
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:46,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We still have the power</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to change our fate.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

158
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We have to fight.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

159
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we must die,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

160
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:55,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we should die as fighters, not as victims.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

161
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Shouldn't our lives</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

162
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:01,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>have value until our very last day?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

163
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:11,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is that woman not afraid at all?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

164
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:13,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Damn her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

165
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:15,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She's inciting a riot.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

166
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let me handle her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

167
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're okay now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

168
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't think about ending your life again.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

169
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Remember this, everyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

170
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:38,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I will get us all out of this hell.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

171
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, open the cage.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

172
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Get out here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

173
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

174
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:58,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Get over here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let go of me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

175
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Move it! Hurry up! Come on!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

176
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You bastards! Let me go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hurry up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

177
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:05,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You scum! Let go of me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Come on!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

178
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My contact said</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

179
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chief Mit is currently out on patrol.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

180
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>From this point, we have to take</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a shortcut through the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

181
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is it far?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

182
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>About 20 kilometers.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

183
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? 20 kilometers?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

184
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is there any other detour?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

185
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>None.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

186
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay, let's grab the bags then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

187
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:12,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know the chief of</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the Border Patrol Police there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

188
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He should be able to assist you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

189
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

190
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:46,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I won't end up like this.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

191
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stay back!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

192
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you going to do?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

193
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>One more step and you'll get hurt!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

194
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

195
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:44,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

196
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is for you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

197
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:06,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Take it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

198
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's your name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

199
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

200
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, what a lovely name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

201
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:28,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you just arrive from Bangkok?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

202
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why did you bring me here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

203
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:36,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No reason at all. Calm down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

204
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I brought you here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

205
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so you could rest in this room.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

206
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:46,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I had my men prepare it</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>just for you to relax.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

207
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:49,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Try anything, and I'll fight to the death.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

208
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just so you know, I'm an ex-cop.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

209
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:53,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, wow!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

210
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:55,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You used to be a cop?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

211
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh dear.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

212
00:18:57,840 --> 00:19:00,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That makes you even more interesting.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

213
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:03,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

214
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What does that mean?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

215
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:10,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I knew it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

216
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:13,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You are absolutely a perfect match.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

217
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:17,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A perfect match for what?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

218
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:41,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>PRICELESS FORESTS</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>SUSTAINABLE THAILAND</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

219
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:49,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's so quiet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

220
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Nobody seems to be here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

221
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:55,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello? Is anyone there?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

222
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:15,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't see any humans.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

223
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then do you see anyone else?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

224
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

225
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:20,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

226
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You, Luang Pho. A human.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

227
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tofu!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

228
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:43,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

229
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chansuek's diamond heist crew.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

230
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Freeze! Police!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

231
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:51,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Cops!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey, take cover, quick!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

232
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, fall back first!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

233
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:41,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Move, fast!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

234
00:22:44,360 --> 00:22:45,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is the police!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

235
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Put your hands up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

236
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't shoot!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

237
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:50,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We are officers too!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

238
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:52,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Drop your weapons!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

239
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:13,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My apologies, Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

240
00:23:13,320 --> 00:23:16,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I thought you were General Kao's militia</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>causing trouble again.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

241
00:23:17,760 --> 00:23:19,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you here, Ms. Ya?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

242
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:22,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We came here specifically</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to find you, Chief Mit.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

243
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:24,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We are tracking someone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

244
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:28,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He is a key suspect wanted by the police.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

245
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:30,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We believe he fled toward the border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

246
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:32,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A key suspect?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

247
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then why come here in secret</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

248
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:36,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>without coordinating</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with the local precinct?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

249
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:41,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This suspect is an undercover agent</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

250
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we planted inside the criminal syndicate.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

251
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But now,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

252
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:48,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we suspect he stole the asset</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and fled on his own.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

253
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:52,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I heard that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

254
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:55,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a monk and a woman</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

255
00:23:55,080 --> 00:23:56,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are currently fleeing toward this border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

256
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:58,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A monk is involved too?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

257
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:02,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BORDER PATROL POLICE COMPANY 3095</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

258
00:24:02,880 --> 00:24:03,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello, Chief.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

259
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:05,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

260
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:06,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A radio report just came in.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

261
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:07,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

262
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:10,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Another woman was abducted</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at the border market</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

263
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:13,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>by people matching</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>General Kao's group's description.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

264
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:18,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who reported it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

265
00:24:18,840 --> 00:24:19,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Which unit?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

266
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:22,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A monk named Luang Pho Padej.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

267
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:25,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He stated that the abducted woman</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

268
00:24:25,080 --> 00:24:27,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is his disciple traveling with him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

269
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:29,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There were three of them in total.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

270
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:35,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But currently,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the male disciple is looking for her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

271
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho Padej.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

272
00:24:51,600 --> 00:24:52,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you know that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

273
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:54,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you are exactly my type?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

274
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:57,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've been looking for</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a woman like you my entire life.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

275
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

276
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What do you mean?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

277
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:08,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want a capable woman who fears no one,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

278
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:12,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so she can help me manage my underlings.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

279
00:25:16,600 --> 00:25:17,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

280
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:20,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you want me to help you with your work?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

281
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:22,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

282
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:27,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then what is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

283
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:35,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want a woman like you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

284
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:38,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to be my life partner.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

285
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:39,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

286
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:42,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Excuse me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

287
00:25:57,840 --> 00:26:00,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Earlier, you asked</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

288
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:02,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what you were a perfect match for.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

289
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you still want to know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

290
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:07,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Not anymore.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

291
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:11,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I want to tell you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

292
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:16,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You are a perfect match to be my wife.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

293
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:20,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>To be the Madam Kao of this camp.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

294
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:21,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Interested?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

295
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:25,080
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>I'm doomed.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

296
00:26:29,080 --> 00:26:30,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

297
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:33,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

298
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:35,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think we just</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

299
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:39,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>met a moment ago.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

300
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:41,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh I see.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

301
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:44,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Haven't you ever heard</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of love at first sight?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

302
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:45,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When it's the right person,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

303
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:49,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>one glance is all it takes to know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

304
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>she's the mother of your children.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

305
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Whoa, wow!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

306
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:57,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Definitely not. I'm really not your type.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

307
00:26:57,840 --> 00:26:59,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

308
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:02,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I have a foul mouth, a terrible temper,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

309
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:06,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I nag, I'm lazy,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and I spend money like water.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

310
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:09,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sometimes I even go to bed</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>without taking a shower.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

311
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:10,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh my!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

312
00:27:10,600 --> 00:27:14,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Everything you just listed</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is not a problem at all.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

313
00:27:14,280 --> 00:27:16,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>In my life,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

314
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:18,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've been with thousands of women.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

315
00:27:19,760 --> 00:27:24,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Some didn't shower for a whole week,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>which is much worse than you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

316
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:28,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yet none of them were fit</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to stand by my side.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

317
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:33,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just want a woman with brains.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

318
00:27:36,520 --> 00:27:38,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? Gosh.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

319
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:41,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm extremely stupid.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

320
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can't even remember</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

321
00:27:43,320 --> 00:27:45,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the twelve times table.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

322
00:27:46,040 --> 00:27:47,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Really?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Goodness.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

323
00:27:47,360 --> 00:27:50,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's even less of a problem</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

324
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:53,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>because I can't even know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the two times table.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

325
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:58,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Look.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

326
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But if you refuse to marry me,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

327
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:05,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll have to send you off</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to be sold immediately.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

328
00:28:07,800 --> 00:28:09,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, I don't want that.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

329
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:11,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

330
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:16,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you'd rather be sold than be my wife?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

331
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You probably don't know that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

332
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:22,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the final destination where you'd be sent</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

333
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:25,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is worse than hell on earth.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

334
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,560
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>What should I do now?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

335
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:45,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

336
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why did we stop?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

337
00:28:49,120 --> 00:28:51,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Could the area ahead be the killing field?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

338
00:28:52,680 --> 00:28:55,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Compared to the killing field,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>this place is child's play.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

339
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Really?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

340
00:28:57,800 --> 00:28:59,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then what do we do next?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

341
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:02,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just let them lead the way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

342
00:29:04,040 --> 00:29:06,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-We don't know the route.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Come on. Liar.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

343
00:29:07,600 --> 00:29:08,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You knew the way out,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

344
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:11,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>which means you must know the way back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

345
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:14,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know you know the trail.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

346
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

347
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Fine, I know.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

348
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we all go together,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

349
00:29:21,360 --> 00:29:22,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we all die.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

350
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:25,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yeah.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

351
00:29:26,080 --> 00:29:29,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about we go first</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and you guys follow us later?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

352
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:31,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't get smart with us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

353
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:33,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know you're trying</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to escape, aren't you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

354
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:34,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

355
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

356
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:38,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go altogether.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

357
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we do that,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

358
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll all die.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

359
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:42,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then choose</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

360
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:45,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>whether to die now</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

361
00:29:45,760 --> 00:29:46,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or later altogether.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

362
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:48,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's your choice?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

363
00:29:48,840 --> 00:29:49,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

364
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:52,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>See? See this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

365
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:54,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

366
00:29:55,800 --> 00:29:58,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on, cut it out. I'll shoot.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

367
00:29:59,040 --> 00:30:00,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Move, walk!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

368
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:05,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've given you plenty of time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

369
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:09,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you don't agree, I won't force you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

370
00:30:12,040 --> 00:30:13,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's a pity,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

371
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:15,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but in that case, tomorrow,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

372
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:19,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I will sell you off along with the others.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

373
00:30:25,840 --> 00:30:26,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

374
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:30,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you honor me this much,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

375
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:32,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then I gladly accept.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

376
00:30:48,800 --> 00:30:50,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you serious?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

377
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

378
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:56,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>On this trip to the border, I actually</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

379
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:57,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>wanted…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

380
00:30:58,760 --> 00:31:00,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>wanted to find true love as well.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

381
00:31:10,120 --> 00:31:11,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

382
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My sweetheart!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

383
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:16,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, hold on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

384
00:31:16,600 --> 00:31:17,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Put your hands down first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

385
00:31:18,520 --> 00:31:19,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

386
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You see,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

387
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:23,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thai women</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

388
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:26,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>don't allow skin-to-skin contact</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>before we're properly married.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

389
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:32,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Otherwise, the ancestral spirits</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>will be angry and our marriage won't last.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

390
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:33,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

391
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:35,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you truly love me,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

392
00:31:36,040 --> 00:31:38,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>please show respect to my parents as well.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

393
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Of course.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

394
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:45,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I promise to hold a grand wedding</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to honor you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

395
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:48,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>tomorrow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

396
00:31:48,800 --> 00:31:50,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? Tomorrow?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

397
00:31:51,560 --> 00:31:52,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

398
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:55,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why so fast?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

399
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:59,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I have a meeting scheduled</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with the leaders,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

400
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:01,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so I can introduce you to them as well.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

401
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why the rush?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

402
00:32:08,400 --> 00:32:09,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>In that case,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

403
00:32:10,600 --> 00:32:14,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>can I ask you for one thing, General?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

404
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:16,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Certainly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

405
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:18,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tell me what you want.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

406
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If it's within my power,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

407
00:32:20,800 --> 00:32:22,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I will grant you everything.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

408
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:28,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

409
00:32:36,280 --> 00:32:37,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

410
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:39,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>WANTED, BOUNTY 100,000 BAHT</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>CONTACT KAMNAN SAWAENG IF SEEN</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

411
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:41,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could you let Kamnan Sawaeng</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

412
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:44,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>issue an arrest warrant</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at his own whim like this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

413
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:47,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is this place some lawless jungle?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

414
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:50,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've only just found out something</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>like this did happen.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

415
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:52,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng is truly out of line.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

416
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:55,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll look into this immediately, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

417
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:59,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I hope you aren't looking the other way</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>because you took his money.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

418
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:02,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's not true.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

419
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:04,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've never accepted money from anyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

420
00:33:05,080 --> 00:33:09,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't let me find any evidence that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you took bribes from Kamnan Sawaeng,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

421
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:12,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or I will destroy your career.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

422
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:16,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm speaking the truth.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

423
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And I also happen to know that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

424
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:20,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you haven't given my men any cooperation.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

425
